# The public ConnectRPC demo service. Useful as a live target that needs no
# local server, and it has server reflection enabled, so `buf curl` works
# against it with no .proto files present.
#
# Verified reachable 2026-09-16.

@base = https://demo.connectrpc.com
@eliza = {{base}}/connectrpc.eliza.v1.ElizaService

### unary -- longhand
POST {{eliza}}/Say
Content-Type: application/json
Connect-Protocol-Version: 1

{"sentence": "hello"}

### unary -- shorthand (milestone 2; not yet parsed)
>> connectrpc.eliza.v1.ElizaService/Say
{"sentence": "hello again"}

### an error: no such method, so the router 404s before Connect sees it
POST {{eliza}}/NoSuchMethod
Content-Type: application/json
Connect-Protocol-Version: 1

{}

### server streaming -- unreadable through curl, decoded by `buf curl`
POST {{eliza}}/Introduce
Content-Type: application/json
Connect-Protocol-Version: 1

{"name": "ada"}
